hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'eed bin Al-Mu'alla (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kehne lagte hain: Main namaaz padh raha tha to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas se guzre aur mujhe bulaya, lekin main unke paas nahi gaya yahan tak ke maine namaaz mukammal kar li. Phir main unke paas gaya to unhon ne farmaya: Tujhe kya cheez roki ki tu na aaya? Kya Allah ne yeh nahi farmaya: (Ae emaan walo! Allah aur Rasool ki dawat qabool karo jab wo tumhein bulayein). Phir farmaya: Main tumhein Qur'an ki sab se azeem surat zaroor sikhaunga mere nikalne se pehle. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikalne ke liye uth gaye to maine unhein yaad dilaya. Aur Mu'adh ne kaha: Shu'bah ne hamein Khubaib se riwayat ki, unhon ne Hafs se suna, unhon ne Abu Sa'eed se suna, jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs the, yeh. Aur unhon ne kaha: Woh (Al-hamdu lillahi rabbil 'aalameen) Sa'at-ul-Masaani hai."
"2","[AI-translation] Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the pas utre, aur ek shakhs unke saath utra. Kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mutawajjih hokar farmaya: Kya main tumhein Qur'an ke behtareen hisse ki khabar na doon? Kaha: Haan. Pas unhon ne tilawat ki {Al-hamdu lillahi rabbil 'aalameen}."
"3","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Ka'b (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, kehne lagte hain: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne na Taurat mein aur na Injeel mein Umm-ul-Qur'an ke jaisa kuch nazil kiya. Woh Sa'at-ul-Masaani hai. Aur yeh mere aur mere bandey ke darmiyan taqseem ki gayi hai. Aur mere bandey ke liye wohi hai jo woh maangta hai."
